       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DAY05-04.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 COMPTEUR PIC 99 VALUE 1.
       01 TOTAL    PIC 99 VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM UNTIL COMPTEUR > 10
               ADD COMPTEUR TO TOTAL
               ADD 1 TO COMPTEUR
           END-PERFORM

           DISPLAY 'TOTAL = ' TOTAL

           STOP RUN.
